+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+/*
+ * Driver for STM32 Digital Camera Memory Interface Pixel Processor
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) STMicroelectronics SA 2026
+ * Authors: Hugues Fruchet <hugues.fruchet@foss.st.com>
